24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.score)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, topK);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"相关性反馈与查询扩展\">相关性反馈与查询扩展</h2><p>Rocchio 算法是 VSM 框架下最经典的查询优化方法。它利用用户对初始检索结果的相关性反馈（标记哪些文档相关、哪些不相关），自动修改查询向量以更接近相关文档、远离不相关文档。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Rocchio 反馈循环&#10;        Q0[初始查询] --&gt; S[检索]&#10;        S --&gt; R[结果展示]&#10;        R --&gt; F[用户反馈]&#10;        F --&gt; RC[Rocchio 修改]&#10;        RC --&gt; Q1[修改后查询]&#10;        Q1 --&gt; S&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Rocchio 反馈循环\n        Q0[初始查询] --&gt; S[检索]\n        S --&gt; R[结果展示]\n        R --&gt; F[用户反馈]\n        F --&gt; RC[Rocchio 修改]\n        RC --&gt; Q1[修改后查询]\n        Q1 --&gt; S\n    end</pre><p>Rocchio 公式为：q&#39; = α × q + β × (相关文档向量均值) - γ × (不相关文档向量均值)。其中 α、β、γ 分别控制原始查询、正向反馈和负向反馈的影响程度。典型参数设置为 α=1, β=0.75, γ=0.15——正向反馈的权重远大于负向反馈，因为用户标记的不相关文档可能只是偶然不相关，不应过度惩罚。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RocchioConfig {&#10;  readonly alpha: number;&#10;  readonly beta: number;&#10;  readonly gamma: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const rocchioUpdate = (&#10;  originalQuery: ReadonlyArray&lt;number&gt;,&#10;  relevantDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;ReadonlyArray&lt;number&gt;&gt;,&#10;  nonRelevantDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;ReadonlyArray&lt;number&gt;&gt;,&#10;  config: RocchioConfig,&#10;): ReadonlyArray&lt;number&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  const dim = originalQuery.length;&#10;  const result = new Array&lt;number&gt;(dim).fill(0);&#10;  const relMean = computeMeanVector(relevantDocs, dim);&#10;  const nonRelMean = computeMeanVector(nonRelevantDocs, dim);&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; dim; i++) {&#10;    result[i] = config.alpha * originalQuery[i] + config.beta * relMean[i] - config.gamma * nonRelMean[i];&#10;    result[i] = Math.max(0, result[i]);&#10;  }&#10;  return result;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const computeMeanVector = (vectors: ReadonlyArray&lt;ReadonlyArray&lt;number&gt;&gt;, dim: number): ReadonlyArray&lt;number&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  if (vectors.length === 0) return new Array(dim).fill(0);&#10;  const mean = new Array&lt;number&gt;(dim).fill(0);&#10;  for (const vec of vectors) {&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; dim; i++) mean[i] += vec[i];&#10;  }&#10;  return mean.map((v) =&gt; v / vectors.length);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RocchioConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark